sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User / Client
    participant C as auth.controller
    participant M as User model
    participant P as protect middleware
    participant R as Resource controller

    U->>C: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
    C->>M: User.findOne({ email }).select("+password")
    C->>M: user.comparePassword(password)
    M-->>C: mismatch returns 401
    C->>C: rejected when blocked (403) or unverified (403)
    C->>C: jwt.sign({ id }, JWT_SECRET, { expiresIn: 30d })
    C-->>U: 200 { token, user }

    Note over U,R: Subsequent protected request
    U->>R: GET /api/pets/my (Authorization: Bearer token)
    R->>P: protect
    P->>P: header missing Bearer scheme returns 401
    P->>P: jwt.verify(token) invalid/expired returns 401
    P->>M: User.findById(decoded.id).select("-password")
    P->>P: blocked returns 403, not found returns 401
    P-->>R: req.user = user
    R->>M: Pet.find({ owner: req.user.id })
    R-->>U: 200 { pets }